Key Column Definitions

**ClosePrice** – Final sale price of the property; this is the target variable for the prediction model.
**LivingArea** – Interior living area of the property, typically measured in square feet.
**BedroomsTotal** – Total number of bedrooms.
**BathroomsTotalInteger** – Total number of bathrooms.
**LotSizeAcres** – Size of the property lot in acres.
**YearBuilt** – Year the property was originally built.
**PropertyType** – General type of property, such as Residential.
**PropertySubType** – More specific property classification, such as SingleFamilyResidence.
**Latitude / Longitude** – Geographic coordinates of the property.
**ListingKey** – Unique identifier for the listing record.
